<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Accès refusé — GEI</title>
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@400;600;700;900&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/bootstrap-icons@1.11.3/font/bootstrap-icons.min.css">
    <style>
        *,*::before,*::after{box-sizing:border-box;margin:0;padding:0}
        body{font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;background:#090e1a;color:#94a3b8;min-height:100vh;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;padding:24px}
        .err-box{max-width:440px;width:100%}
        .err-code{font-size:88px;font-weight:900;line-height:1;color:#1e293b;letter-spacing:-4px;margin-bottom:8px}
        .err-icon{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;width:64px;height:64px;border-radius:16px;background:rgba(239,68,68,.08);border:1px solid rgba(239,68,68,.2);font-size:26px;color:#f87171;margin-bottom:20px}
        .err-title{font-size:20px;font-weight:700;color:#f1f5f9;margin-bottom:10px}
        .err-sub{font-size:13px;line-height:1.7;color:#64748b;margin-bottom:28px}
        .err-btn{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;padding:10px 22px;background:rgba(251,191,36,.1);border:1px solid rgba(251,191,36,.25);border-radius:8px;color:#fbbf24;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;text-decoration:none;transition:opacity .15s}
        .err-btn:hover{opacity:.8}
        .err-sep{margin:0 10px;color:#334155}
        .err-link{color:#64748b;font-size:12px;text-decoration:none}
        .err-link:hover{color:#94a3b8}
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <div class="err-box">
        <div class="err-code">403</div>
        <div class="err-icon"><i class="bi bi-shield-lock"></i></div>
        <h1 class="err-title">Accès refusé</h1>
        <p class="err-sub">Vous n'avez pas les droits nécessaires pour accéder à cette ressource.<br>Si vous pensez qu'il s'agit d'une erreur, contactez votre administrateur.</p>
        <a href="/" class="err-btn"><i class="bi bi-house-fill"></i>Tableau de bord</a>
        <span class="err-sep">·</span>
        <a href="javascript:history.back()" class="err-link">← Retour</a>
    </div>
</body>
</html>
